<title>USA: Zurich Capital Trust to issue capital securities.</title>
<headline>Zurich Capital Trust to issue capital securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zurich Capital Trust is expected to issue $750 million in capital securities via the 144A private placement market as early as Wednesday, syndicate sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Aa2/AA rated issue is expected to include a 40-year maturity, callable in 10-years, sources said.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc is expected to underwrite the offering, sources added.</p>
<p>(( -- Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
